  "title": "Week 19: Unreal on Web",
  "date": "2025-05-08T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 19: Unreal on Web\n\nUnity Async Experience\n\nI have finished one development cycle of an Unity project. In this project, I tried to use ChatGPT to give the player comment. At the same time, I can try to use async functions to make net request.\n\nThe function looks like this:\n\nPretty weird, I have to use await Task.Yield() to wait for the request. I think it is because UnityWebRequest is not a real async function. It just uses a coroutine to make the request. So I have to use Task.Yield() to wait for the coroutine.",
